    "DT_ItemDescriptionText": {
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_001_Lv033_SparkOfChaos": "Lv. 33 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Sir Clucks-a-Lot. A Chikipi that survived being called dinner one too many times. It has chosen violence, vengeance, and extremely aggressive pecking. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_002_Lv035_WildSprouts": "Lv. 35 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Lifmunk, Certified Nut Auditor. This Lifmunk has reviewed your acorn inventory and found several serious discrepancies. Payment is now due in bruises. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_003_Lv037_NightCurrent": "Lv. 37 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Depresso, Employee of the Month. A Depresso fueled entirely by bad moods and unpaid overtime. It does not want to be here, and now neither do you. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_004_Lv038_DragonEmbers": "Lv. 38 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Dinossom, Zero Chill. Someone stepped on Dinossom's tail. Nobody will admit who did it, so Dinossom has decided everyone is guilty. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_005_Lv040_FrozenRoots": "Lv. 40 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Jolthog Cryst, Pocket Freezer. A tiny frozen hedgehog with the emotional stability of a live grenade. Cute, cold, and absolutely not approved for indoor use. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_006_Lv041_StormTide": "Lv. 41 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Celaray, The Angry Bedsheet. Celaray has spent years being used as transportation and has finally filed a formal complaint by becoming the transportation straight into the floor. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_007_Lv043_ShadowFlame": "Lv. 43 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Professor Hoot N. Holler. Hoocrates knows everything, including exactly how badly this fight is about to go. Unfortunately, the lecture includes practical demonstrations. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_008_Lv045_VerdantSky": "Lv. 45 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Caprity, Regional Berry Manager. Caprity has promoted itself to regional manager of all berries. Your base was not approved by corporate. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_009_Lv046_StoneTempest": "Lv. 46 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Eikthyrdeer, Head of Branch Management. Those antlers are not decorative. Eikthyrdeer has arrived to restructure your entire organization, beginning with your rib cage. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_010_Lv048_FrostedAbyss": "Lv. 48 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Nox, The 3 A.M. Problem. Nox is what happens when you hear something outside at 3 A.M. and make the terrible decision to investigate. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_011_Lv049_PrimalSpark": "Lv. 49 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Jolthog, OSHA Violation. Ten million volts wrapped in a face that says 'pet me.' This is less a boss fight and more an electrical safety seminar. It calls 2 backup Pals at 70% HP and 3 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_012_Lv051_WyrmTide": "Lv. 51 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Dinossom, Anger Management Dropout. Dinossom attended one anger-management class, ate the paperwork, and declared the program completed. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_013_Lv053_NightBloom": "Lv. 53 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Tombat, Ceiling Fan Inspector. Tombat has entered the building without permission and would like to inspect every ceiling, wall, and vulnerable player. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_014_Lv054_ThunderStone": "Lv. 54 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Sparkit, Licensed Electrician-ish. Sparkit insists it is fully licensed. Nobody has seen the paperwork, and the last three customers are still smoking. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_015_Lv056_InfernalFrost": "Lv. 56 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Rooby, Mildly On Fire. Rooby would like everyone to remain calm while it runs around the arena actively on fire. This request will not be honored. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_016_Lv057_LivingStorm": "Lv. 57 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Bristla, Thornado Supreme. Bristla is proof that the garden can fight back. Please keep hands, feet, and expensive armor away from the shrubbery. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_017_Lv059_AbyssalEarth": "Lv. 59 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Eikthyrdeer, Senior Branch Manager. Promoted since the last encounter, Eikthyrdeer now has seniority, larger antlers, and absolutely no respect for your personal space. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_018_Lv060_SkyfireTorrent": "Lv. 60 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Foxparks, Definitely House Trained. Foxparks promises it is house trained. Your insurance company strongly disagrees and has stopped answering the phone. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_019_Lv062_ElementalCrown": "Lv. 62 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Jolthog Cryst, Freezer Burn. The freezer has achieved consciousness, grown spikes, and developed a personal issue with you. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice.",
        "ITEM_DESC_PalSummon_MRB8_020_Lv063_TrialOfEight": "Lv. 63 SINGLE BOSS RAID: Tocotoco, Safety Manual Optional. Tocotoco has never read a safety manual and considers explosions a communication style. Stand somewhere else. Preferably another island. It calls 3 backup Pals at 70% HP and 4 backup Pals at 40% HP because apparently fighting fair was never discussed. Offer this slab to the Summoning Altar when you are ready to make a questionable life choice."
    }
}
